<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:8:10"><p>
	<strong>Items We Need Often</strong><br>
	Feel free to drop off food donations of these items at our office or shelter locations anytime. 
</p>

